{# Photographer's credit for a picture the site does not host.

   One partial rather than three copies: the banner, the grid and the gallery
   all owe the same line, and a provider that changes what it requires should
   be answered in a single place.

   `rel="nofollow noopener"` because the link is an obligation, not an
   endorsement, and `utm` parameters are already carried by the URL - the
   importer put them there, since that is what the API guidelines ask for. #}
<p class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted">
    {% if credit.url %}
        <a href="{{ credit.url }}" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" class="hover:underline">{{ credit.name }}</a>
    {% else %}
        {{ credit.name }}
    {% endif %}
    <span aria-hidden="true"> · </span>
    <a href="https://unsplash.com/?utm_source=aurora&amp;utm_medium=referral" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" class="hover:underline">Unsplash</a>
</p>
